  "description": "Only a small fraction of the world gets a flashy, impressive power, but even that’s more common than not having one. Before she knows it, Joori Ahn is almost through her twenties and still powerless. She tells herself that’s better than getting a weird one—something the universe must have taken as a challenge. This isn’t just any weird power; this is a curse! Except, if her clothes transforming in front of her crush gets him to finally notice her, who could blame her for testing the waters?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes seven extra chapters.*",
